- **Setup:**
  1. `mamba env create -f environment.yml` (or `mamba env update -n {{ENV_NAME}} --file environment.yml`)
  2. Verify: `mamba run -n {{ENV_NAME}} python -c "import {{PRIMARY_PACKAGE}}; print('OK')"`

## AWM Integration

This project is managed by AWM. Common operations:

```bash
# Create a task
awm task create {{PROJECT_NAME}} <task-name>

# List tasks
awm task list --project {{PROJECT_NAME}}

# Log a session
awm session log {{PROJECT_NAME}} <task-name> --summary "..." --agent <agent-id>

# Complete a task
awm task complete {{PROJECT_NAME}} <task-name> [--merge]
```

AWM is also available as an MCP server — Claude Code can use tools like `task_create`, `session_log`, `skills_search` directly.

